# contacts' exclusion lists (core/modules/contacts/README.md "Routes", gamma-p2-045): a CSV of company
# domains imported as one list of customers or competitors, the workspace's lists, and a list
# removed. The upload's file is written inline below, made-up domains only; a row that is no domain
# comes back as its number and its code. Every role imports and lists; only an Owner or an Admin
# removes. Put an `exclusionListId` the upload or the list answers in http-client.private.env.json.
# A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin too.

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/contacts/exclusions/imports: imports the file as one list of customers, each domain an entry on every channel, the leads at it suppressed; 201 with the list, what it added, its duplicates and the rows without an entry; 400 exclusions_unsupported_type, exclusions_bad_encoding, exclusions_missing_column, exclusions_too_many_rows or exclusions_no_valid_row, 413 exclusions_too_large
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/contacts/exclusions/imports?relationship=customer
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WhytideExclusionsBoundary
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

--WhytideExclusionsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="customers.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

company,domain
Example Harbor,harbor.example
Example Quay,https://www.quay.example/
Not a domain,=1+1
--WhytideExclusionsBoundary--

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/contacts/exclusions/lists: the workspace's lists, newest first, a page at a time, the removed ones with their removal
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/contacts/exclusions/lists?limit=20
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### DELETE /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/contacts/exclusions/lists/{listId}: removes the list and its active entries, kept on record with their removal; 204; 404 exclusion_list_not_found for an unknown list, another workspace's or one removed already
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/contacts/exclusions/lists/{{exclusionListId}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
